        "created_at": "2016-01-24T04:45:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Keep in mind the concern with the box art is how it looks on the shelf at the store – so it's focused on the side. And the side of the Tactics boxes is very simple, with little to catch the eye or indicate what it is.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>",
